# Glassfort Dark – Glassfort colour scheme. Palette: D-22 in docs/DECISIONS.md
# (Glacier Teal #3DD6C6, Fort Indigo #4C4FE0, Midnight #0E1222,
# Frost #F5F7FA, Steel #8B93A7). Text colours meet WCAG AA (4.5:1) on
# window, view and button backgrounds. Structure follows Breeze.

